



:: day_4_21_les

<<leo "…Just a quick look. Not a real login. Just enough to help Ava tomorrow." >>

I lifted the helmet. Light spilled along my fingers, warm, steady. My chest felt tight with a mix of exhaustion and responsibility. Ava’s voice echoed softly the shaky, hopeful way she’d asked me to learn the world first so she didn’t panic.

<<leo "For her. Just for her." >>

I slid the wristband on. It tightened automatically. The helmet warmed as I lowered it over my head. Darkness folded in. A single golden line appeared, trembling like a heartbeat.

<<system "Neural sync initializing." >>

I exhaled slowly.

<<leo "Okay… that’s normal. Come on. Show me Lumira." >>

The line stretched then stuttered. A sharp crack sliced through the gold. My pulse jumped.

<<leo "…huh? What was " >>

The light jittered violently.

<<system "Warning: scan data corruption detected." >>

My stomach dropped.

<<leo "No, no what? I’m right here. The scan was fine this morning." >>

The fragments of the golden line broke apart like splintering glass.

<<system "Rebooting. corrupted identity file unstable." >>

I felt something tighten around the base of my skull like the system was reaching deeper than it should.

<<leo "Stop the reboot. Abort. Exit to menu!" >>

Nothing responded. The void vibrated, heavy and pulsing.

<<system "Primary avatar data unavailable. Generating replacement avatar using subconscious aesthetics, emotional-resonance profile, and long-term comfort optimization." >>

My breath froze in my throat.

<<leo "Wait no. Use my scan. Use my body data. Don’t generate anything!" >>

The golden shards swirled around me, forming a ring.

<<system "Emotional resonance profile detected: HIGH. Subconscious aesthetic profile: ACTIVE." >>

More pulses. Scanning tones.

<<system "Optimal long-term comfort model: FEMALE." >>

My heart slammed against my ribs.

<<leo "NO That’s wrong! I’m male! Use my " >>

<<system "Subconscious identity imprint located." >>

A warm pressure wrapped around me, tightening like a cocoon.

<<system "Designation selected: LEONA." >>

Everything inside me lurched.

<<leo "Stop! Don’t " >>

The system didn’t listen. The light collapsed inward, swallowing my protest.

<<system "Avatar generation sequence beginning." >>

The change rushed toward me like a wave.

/* [[Golden cocoon tightened around me|day_4_22_les]] */

